st.2024"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $132 billion in FY2025, 18.4% of revenue; in FY2020 it was $40.1 billion, 10.4%.","cites":["AMZN.capex.2025","AMZN.revenue.2025","AMZN.capex.2020","AMZN.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2025 was $38.3 billion, about 39 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 52 days, at the end of FY2017.","cites":["AMZN.inventory.2025","AMZN.cost.2025","AMZN.inventory.2017","AMZN.cost.2017"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2025 was North America: $426 billion, 59% of revenue.","cites":["AMZN.mix.segment.2025.0","AMZN.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was United States: $490 billion, 68% of revenue.","cites":["AMZN.mix.geography.2025.0","AMZN.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2025 was Online stores: $269 billion, 38% of revenue.","cites":["AMZN.mix.product.2025.0","AMZN.revenue.2025"]}]}}